meta {
  name: QR code exists
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/common/qrcode?qrcode_number=<qrcode>
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  qrcode_number: <qrcode>
}

docs {
  No login. Returns the card in effect today (start_date <= today <= end_date). Answers 400 `cannot generate qr code` when there is none. It also answers 400 while a request of types 3-11 runs, since the Old card stops being valid when it starts. A type 2 (expired card) request leaves the Old card valid.
}
